WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.312 --> 00:00:02.947
AstraZeneca may be able to help.

00:00:14.392 --> 00:00:15.560
&gt;&gt; Tucker: AMERICA HAS

00:00:14.993 --> 00:00:15.927
EXPERIENCED A RAPID INFLATION

00:00:15.693 --> 00:00:16.661
ENGENDERS.

00:00:16.061 --> 00:00:17.495
AT ONE POINT, BIOLOGISTS WERE

00:00:16.795 --> 00:00:19.631
ALLOWED TO DETERMINE WHAT

00:00:17.629 --> 00:00:20.665
BIOLOGY WAS AND THERE WERE TWO,

00:00:19.764 --> 00:00:23.835
MALE AND FEMALE.

00:00:20.799 --> 00:00:24.536
NOW THERE IS A GENDER, BY

00:00:23.968 --> 00:00:25.970
GENDER, PERJURE, HE DRUG, WE

00:00:24.669 --> 00:00:25.970
COULD GO ON

00:00:28.239 --> 00:00:30.909
FOREVER.

00:00:29.974 --> 00:00:33.645
NOT EVERYONE AGREES, SOME PEOPLE

00:00:31.042 --> 00:00:34.712
BELIEVE IN SCIENCE AT THEIR

00:00:33.778 --> 00:00:36.514
PERIL, IT TURNS OUT.

00:00:34.846 --> 00:00:38.750
LAKE INGLE IS ONE OF THEM.

00:00:36.648 --> 00:00:40.218
HE'S A STUDENT AT THE UNIVERSITY

00:00:38.883 --> 00:00:42.220
OF PENNSYLVANIA AND A RELIGION

00:00:40.351 --> 00:00:43.721
CLASS, HE STATED HIS BELIEF THAT

00:00:42.353 --> 00:00:46.658
THERE ARE TWO GENDERS BECAUSE

00:00:43.855 --> 00:00:49.060
AGAIN, THAT'S BIOLOGY.

00:00:46.791 --> 00:00:49.761
HE WAS TOLD HE HAD TO APOLOGIZE

00:00:49.194 --> 00:00:53.064
AND FRONT OF THE CLASS WHILE

00:00:49.894 --> 00:00:54.232
THEY CRITIQUED HIM.

00:00:53.198 --> 00:00:56.434
HE JOINS US TONIGHT.

00:00:54.365 --> 00:00:57.769
THANKS FOR COMING ON.

00:00:56.568 --> 00:01:01.439
&gt;&gt; THANKS FOR HAVING ME.

00:00:57.902 --> 00:01:02.707
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YOU HAD THIS

00:01:01.573 --> 00:01:03.908
PROFESSOR, ALLISON DOWNEY WHO

00:01:02.841 --> 00:01:05.343
WAS SO THREATENED BECAUSE YOU

00:01:04.042 --> 00:01:08.546
DISAGREED WITH HER THAT SHE

00:01:05.477 --> 00:01:10.482
TRIED TO GET YOU TO SIGN SOME

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:12.183
FORM APOLOGIZING FOR YOUR

00:01:10.615 --> 00:01:16.454
UNORTHODOX NOT ALLOWED THOUGHTS

00:01:12.317 --> 00:01:18.356
AND THEN WHAT HAPPENED?

00:01:16.588 --> 00:01:21.426
&gt;&gt; SHE ASKED THAT I WOULD SIGN A

00:01:18.490 --> 00:01:23.328
DOCUMENT COMPLYING WITH HER

00:01:21.559 --> 00:01:25.029
ASKING ME TO APOLOGIZE TO THE

00:01:23.461 --> 00:01:25.497
CLASS AS WELL AS GIVING HER A

00:01:25.163 --> 00:01:26.397
WRITTEN APOLOGY.

00:01:25.630 --> 00:01:30.168
SHE ASKED I WOULD STAND IN FRONT

00:01:26.531 --> 00:01:31.903
OF THE CLASS IN SILENCE AS I

00:01:30.301 --> 00:01:36.174
APOLOGIZED AND THEY WOULD GIVE

00:01:32.036 --> 00:01:37.609
ANY COMMENTS ON MY OUTBURST.

00:01:36.307 --> 00:01:39.244
&gt;&gt; Tucker: DID SHE SAY WHAT

00:01:37.742 --> 00:01:39.844
SPECIFICALLY SHE WAS SO OFFENDED

00:01:39.377 --> 00:01:42.213
BY?

00:01:39.978 --> 00:01:44.015
&gt;&gt; SHE DIDN'T LIKE THE FACT THAT

00:01:42.347 --> 00:01:46.217
I DISAGREED WITH THE SUBJECT

00:01:44.149 --> 00:01:47.785
BEING PUSHED IN CLASS, BEING

00:01:46.351 --> 00:01:50.188
MORE THAN ONE GENDER, MALE

00:01:47.919 --> 00:01:51.089
PRIVILEGE, SYSTEMIC SEXISM AND

00:01:50.321 --> 00:01:51.089
MAN'S PLANING

00:01:55.026 --> 00:02:03.434
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IS MANSPLAINING A

00:02:02.567 --> 00:02:03.868
MEASURABLE THING QUESTION MIKE

00:02:03.568 --> 00:02:04.903
WHAT IS THAT?

00:02:05.036 --> 00:02:13.211
SPEAKS REALLY.

00:02:07.839 --> 00:02:15.446
IT IS NOT MEASURABLE.

00:02:13.344 --> 00:02:16.147
&gt;&gt; Tucker: OF COURSE, IT'S

00:02:15.580 --> 00:02:18.249
PROPAGANDA.

00:02:16.281 --> 00:02:19.584
WHAT WAS IT THAT YOU SAID

00:02:18.383 --> 00:02:19.851
SPECIFICALLY THAT MADE HER SO

00:02:19.717 --> 00:02:23.321
MAD?

00:02:19.984 --> 00:02:26.524
&gt;&gt; I FIRST REFERENCED THE

00:02:23.454 --> 00:02:27.659
ECONOMISTS AND STATED THAT

00:02:26.658 --> 00:02:29.294
BIOLOGIST DON'T AGREE THAT THERE

00:02:27.792 --> 00:02:31.996
ARE MORE THAN TWO GENDERS, THEY

00:02:29.427 --> 00:02:32.830
DON'T BELIEVE THAT THERE ARE 72

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:33.331
GENDERS OR MORE

00:02:32.964 --> 00:02:33.631
ACROSS-THE-BOARD.

00:02:33.464 --> 00:02:35.533
MOST.

00:02:33.765 --> 00:02:39.637
MOST OF THEM DISAGREE.

00:02:35.667 --> 00:02:42.240
SHE DIDN'T APPRECIATE THAT.

00:02:39.771 --> 00:02:42.807
&gt;&gt; Tucker: BY CITING THE

00:02:42.373 --> 00:02:46.844
LONG-STANDING VIEW OF

00:02:42.941 --> 00:02:48.446
BIOLOGISTS, THE HARD SCIENTISTS

00:02:46.978 --> 00:02:49.180
ALLISON DOWNEY, SHE'S A

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:50.148
PROFESSOR, SHE TRIED TO GET YOU

00:02:49.314 --> 00:02:51.749
TO STAND IN FRONT OF THE CLASS

00:02:50.281 --> 00:02:52.750
TO TAKE ABUSE.

00:02:51.883 --> 00:02:54.285
DID YOU DO THAT?

00:02:52.884 --> 00:02:55.453
&gt;&gt; NO, I DIDN'T.

00:02:54.419 --> 00:02:57.488
I WAS SUPPOSED TO COME UP SHE

00:02:55.587 --> 00:02:59.457
DIDN'T GIVE ME A CHANCE.

00:02:57.622 --> 00:03:01.159
I WAS GIVEN TEN DAYS TO COMPLY,

00:02:59.591 --> 00:03:04.696
BUT THE DAY AFTER SHE ASKED THIS

00:03:01.292 --> 00:03:06.030
OF ME, SHE DECIDED TO PUSH IT TO

00:03:04.829 --> 00:03:07.131
THE UNIVERSITY PROVOST OFFICE TO

00:03:06.164 --> 00:03:08.466
THEN HOLD A HEARING WHICH WOULD

00:03:07.265 --> 00:03:10.902
DECIDE WHETHER OR NOT I COULD BE

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:11.569
ALLOWED IN CLASS PERIOD.

00:03:11.035 --> 00:03:14.038
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHY DO YOU GO TO

00:03:11.703 --> 00:03:17.041
THIS SCHOOL?

00:03:14.172 --> 00:03:17.442
WHAT ARE YOU GETTING OUT OF THIS

00:03:17.175 --> 00:03:18.843
EXACTLY?

00:03:17.575 --> 00:03:19.811
&gt;&gt; I INITIALLY WENT FOR

00:03:18.977 --> 00:03:22.814
ATHLETICS MY FRESHMAN YEAR, BUT

00:03:19.944 --> 00:03:24.549
THAT'S A LONG GONE DREAM NOW.

00:03:22.947 --> 00:03:26.050
I'M PRETTY MUCH JUST STUCK HERE.

00:03:24.682 --> 00:03:28.219
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I WISH I COULD HIRE

00:03:26.184 --> 00:03:30.888
YOU, I WOULD ENCOURAGE YOU OR

00:03:28.353 --> 00:03:31.256
ANYONE ELSE TO JOIN THE

00:03:31.022 --> 00:03:32.056
WORKFORCE.

00:03:31.389 --> 00:03:35.026
IT'S NOT WORTH IT.

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:36.094
THIS IS A JOKE.

